"小栗彩朱佳（IG@_assunsun_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260806/1162080214428553216654302.jpeg/_nL-VuCnYS2iGuZMsAzDAywh9ZgdDginlo8tD5aPLQ8\"/><figcaption>小栗彩朱佳（IG@_assunsun_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"小栗彩朱佳（IG@_assunsun_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260806/1162080212574539776467285.jpeg/-z-uIxesPP8afnklCDGht3zCmiG-ZLgcI_lAwSP5QME\"/><figcaption>小栗彩朱佳（IG@_assunsun_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"小栗彩朱佳（IG@_assunsun_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260806/1162080207285260288413962.jpeg/Zw7xKxK3CfOk9p9APXWg4uuDcGWQfo2oHLsUJxy7FCc\"/><figcaption>小栗彩朱佳（IG@_assunsun_）</figcaption></figure><p>「營業中」莎莎面臨精神錯亂 吳映潔外場神救援</p><p>「綜藝一級棒」班底吳俊宏當評審 當眾點名「最想淘汰郭婷筠」</p><p>【本文獲「聯合新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-13T12:39:49.313948+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1778,"images":32,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}